'''''Frankenia capitata''''' is a [[species]] of [[flowering plant]] in the family [[Fabaceae]], native to southern [[Macaronesia]] (the [[Canary Islands]], [[Madeira]] and the [[Savage Islands|Salvage Islands]]).<ref name=POWO_366232-1/>

